  "notes": "{勝手|かって} expresses acting according to one's own will, often selfishly.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {勝手|かって}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧〜⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (do ~ without permission)\n- {勝手|かって}な〜 (selfish ~)\n- ⟦{自分|じぶん}→自分：02887_jibun⟧{勝手|かって} (self-centered)\n- お⟦{好|す}きに→好き：02355_suki⟧{勝手|かって}に (as you like)\n\nUSAGE:\n1. Selfishness: {勝手|かって}な⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧ (selfish person)\n2. Without permission: {勝手|かって}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{入|はい}る→入る：00494_hairu⟧ (enter without permission)\n3. Kitchen area (historical usage): お{勝手|かって}\n\nNote: {勝手|かって}にしろ means \"do what you want\" (I don't care).",
